; ============================================================
;  ARMOR MAG POUCHES - loot tiers for the chest rigs
;
;  GENERATED by art/mkloot.py from l_amp_rigs.ltx. How good a rig is and
;  how rare it should be are the same fact stated twice; deriving one
;  from the other is what stops them drifting. Change the slot counts and
;  re-run BOTH generators (mkcraft.py too).
;
;  Loot comes from `60- Stash Overhaul - Grokitach`, whose
;  treasure_manager.script reads two files and needs an item in BOTH:
;  this one, and its partner. Tier 1 is the commonest, 5 the rarest, and
;  the mod's own defaults cap common stashes at 3 and rare at 4.
;
; Patrontash             1/0/1/3   9 cells  worth 10.0 -> tier 1, common and rare stashes
; Razvedka Sling         0/2/1/3  11 cells  worth 12.0 -> tier 1, common and rare stashes
; Cordon Rig             2/0/1/3  13 cells  worth 14.8 -> tier 2, common and rare stashes
; Barakholka Rig         0/2/2/4  14 cells  worth 15.2 -> tier 2, common and rare stashes
; Vydra Swamp Rig        2/0/3/3  17 cells  worth 19.2 -> tier 3, common and rare stashes
; 6Sh92 Surplus Rig      0/4/1/4  18 cells  worth 19.8 -> tier 3, common and rare stashes
; Vepr Nylon Rig         1/2/2/4  18 cells  worth 20.0 -> tier 3, common and rare stashes
; Smersh-AK              3/0/3/3  21 cells  worth 24.0 -> tier 4, rare stashes only
; Karkas Field Harness   1/2/4/4  22 cells  worth 24.4 -> tier 4, rare stashes only
; Lifchik                1/4/1/4  22 cells  worth 24.6 -> tier 4, rare stashes only
; Bastion Patrol Rig     2/2/2/4  22 cells  worth 24.8 -> tier 4, rare stashes only
; Volya Raider Rig       3/2/0/4  22 cells  worth 25.2 -> tier 4, rare stashes only
; Leshy                  1/4/2/4  24 cells  worth 26.8 -> tier 5, NOT FOUND AT ALL - craft only, at the mod's default caps
; Tarzan-M22             2/2/3/4  24 cells  worth 27.0 -> tier 5, NOT FOUND AT ALL - craft only, at the mod's default caps
; Rubezh Carrier         2/2/4/4  26 cells  worth 29.2 -> tier 5, NOT FOUND AT ALL - craft only, at the mod's default caps
; Shturm Carrier         4/2/0/4  26 cells  worth 30.0 -> tier 5, NOT FOUND AT ALL - craft only, at the mod's default caps
;
; Small mag pouch        (no pockets)             -> tier 2, common and rare stashes
; Medium mag pouch       (no pockets)             -> tier 3, common and rare stashes
; Large mag pouch        (no pockets)             -> tier 4, rare stashes only
; ============================================================

; The rig sections are ours, so they need no override marker.
; The three pouches at the bottom are the magazine mod's and
; carry one - nobody else declares them here today (checked in
; the installed pack: neither grok_items_tier.ltx nor
; treasure_manager.ltx mentions af_magpouch_*), and a foreign
; name declared plainly is a fatal startup error the day
; somebody else does.


