; ============================================================
;  THE POUCH LADDER
;
;  Tier 1 is commonest and 5 rarest - and the stash mod caps rare
;  stashes at 4, so tier 5 would be found nowhere. Nothing here is set
;  to it: the ladder is meant to be found as well as bought.
;
;  THE RED PAIR SIT AT 4 with the best of the others. They are the
;  scarcest pockets in the game and a lucky early find should feel
;  like one.
; ============================================================
