; ============================================================
;  THE STOCK THREE ARE OUT OF THE STASHES
;
;  Tier 5, which the stash mod never rolls - its own defaults cap
;  common stashes at 3 and rare at 4. They were 2, 3 and 4.
;
;  They are NOT removed and NOT un-craftable, because all sixteen rig
;  recipes are priced in them: a rig costs what it would cost to reach
;  that shape by bolting pouches onto a strap. Take them away and the
;  whole rig ladder becomes unbuildable.
;
;  So they stop being LOOT and stay being MATERIALS, which is what
;  they are for. The eleven coloured pouches are what a player fits.
;
;  WHAT THIS DOES NOT REACH: traders and corpses. Their trade lines
;  live in the magazine mod's own files, which are not part of this
;  set, and NPC drops are the eight rank sliders in Squared Away's
;  MCM - set the three pouch sliders to 0 there if you want them off
;  bodies as well.
; ============================================================
